<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Druid Spells</h1>
<p>The spells the Druids' guild teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name               Level   Up to
Sense Life             1   100%
Thorn Strike           2   100%
Bark Skin              3   80%
Glowing Fungus         5   80%
Sense Invisible        6   100%
Summer Rain            7   80%
Mud Puddle             8   70%
Refresh                8   80%
Poison Ivy             9   100%
Wind Slash            10   70%
Brambles              12   90%
Detect Alignment      12   70%
Heal Animal           13   50%
Life Protection       14   90%
Charm Animal          15   50%
Detect Poison         16   100%
Ice Thorn             17   70%
Locate Animal         19   50%
Entangle              21   80%
Hedge Wall            21   100%
Sustain               22   80%
Sun Beam              24   100%
Remove Disease        25   50%
Calm                  26   50%
Remove Poison         28   50%
Cure Blind            29   80%
Petrify               30   80%
Quicksand             31   50%
Find Path             34   70%
Locate Object         35   50%
Locate Person         37   100%
Sun Ray               41   80%
Clear Skies           43   50%
Leaf Shield           47   80%
Tsunami               52   50%
Summon Lightning      60   50%
Earthquake            90   70%
Solar Flare          110   100%
Polarity             120   60%
</pre>
